  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pat has a new friend. Her name is Eva. Pat says the words. His sister May writes them. May has a pencil and a white page. Pat smiles at the page. \"Hi, Eva! My name is Pat. I am five years old. I am young, but I am not a baby. How old are you?\"",
      "\"I live in a white house. It is next to a school. My sister May is eight years old. She goes to the school. I love her a lot. Her teacher is Teacher Kim. She is a young woman. Is your teacher a woman or a man? Where do you live?\"",
      "\"I have a small friend. His name is Squeaky. He is a mouse. He lives in the garden. He is a baby mouse. Do you have a pet? Write to me, Eva! Bye! Pat\" Pat writes his name. It is a short word. Pat is very happy."
    ],
